      "They lived together as husband and wife, but later Virendra Kumar allegedly stopped maintaining her.",
      "Chanmuniya filed a petition under Section 125 CrPC seeking maintenance.",
      "The dispute raised the question of whether a woman in a long-term relationship resembling marriage could claim maintenance under Section 125 even where a legally valid marriage was disputed."
