      "The agreement was a domestic arrangement made in the context of a marital relationship.",
      "The Court observed that domestic and social agreements are generally presumed not to create legal relations.",
      "The case established the importance of intention to create legal relations in determining whether an agreement is a contract.",
      "This presumption is not absolute; the circumstances may show that the parties intended legal consequences."
